  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひたすらに　あさせを　はしりこんであしこしを　きたえ　！\u0004\u0006仲間同士なかまどうし仲間同士であしわざの　かれいさを　きそいあう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "열심히 얕은 여울을 달리며 하반신을 단련하고, 동료들끼리 발 기술의 화려함을 겨룬다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會在淺灘不斷跑步來鍛鍊下盤的筋骨，好跟夥伴們競爭誰的腿技最為華麗。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils courent dans les hauts-fonds pour renforcer les muscles de leurs pattes et rivalisent entre eux pour voir qui a le coup de pied le plus élégant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es rennt eifrig durch seichte Gewässer, um seine Beine zu stärken, und konkurriert mit Artgenossen darum, wer die anmutigste Beinarbeit vorweist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fortalece las extremidades corriendo con tesón por los bajíos. Compite con los suyos para ver cuál posee una técnica más grácil con las patas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Corre senza sosta in acque poco profonde per allenare gli arti inferiori così da fare a gara con i propri simili a chi ha le movenze più eleganti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "These Pokémon constantly run through shallow waters to train their legs, then compete with each other to see which of them kicks most gracefully.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひたすらに　浅瀬を　走り込んで足腰を　鍛え　！\u0004\u0006仲間同士なかまどうし仲間同士で足技の　華麗さを　競いあう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "通过在浅滩持续奔跑来锻炼腰腿，借此与伙伴比拼谁的腿技更为华丽。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fortalece las extremidades corriendo con tesón por los bajíos. Compite con los suyos para ver cuál posee una técnica más grácil con las patas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "さまざまな　ちほうの　ポケモンやひとの　うごきを　みて　みずからのおどりに　とりいれる　どりょくか。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "다양한 지방의 포켓몬과 사람의 움직임을 보고 자신의 춤으로 승화시키는 노력가.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "個性勤奮，會觀察各地區的人和寶可夢，並將其動作融入自己的舞蹈裡。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Très diligent, il observe les mouvements de Pokémon et d’individus d’origines diverses pour s’en inspirer quand il danse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses fleißige Pokémon beobachtet Menschen sowie Pokémon aus diversen Regionen und baut ihre Bewegungen in seine eigenen Tänze ein.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon diligente que ha creado su propio estilo de danza tras observar los movimientos de humanos y Pokémon de varias regiones.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Estremamente diligente, osserva le movenze di esseri umani e Pokémon di altre regioni per incorporarle nelle proprie danze.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The hardworking Quaxwell observes people and Pokémon from various regions and incorporates their movements into its own dance routines.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "様々な　地方の　ポケモンや人の　動きを　見て　自らの踊りに　取り入れる　努力家。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "性情勤奋。会观察各个地区的人和宝可梦的动作来吸取到自己的舞蹈里。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
